  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported SetFullJobInfo, AnalyzeModel, GetConnectedProjectInfo and both SetConnectedProjectInfo overloads with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Preserved literal thirteen-field job text and explicit engine selection; validated project success flags and output buffers with immutable named results. Retained constructing-thread, current-binding, lifetime and reentrancy guards. Forty-five Root operations are implemented; see the job/analysis/projects guide for consumer contracts and native qualification limits.",
